## Programme

- 09:00 Where the week goes
- 10:30 Break
- 11:00 Three processes to fix first
- 12:30 Questions

The event is over. Slides are available on request.

## What we covered

Most growing companies meet the same three problems: approvals that used to be quick, handovers that depend on one person, and reports that nobody trusts. In the workshop, participants mapped their own week, then picked the process that cost the most time.

## Feedback

Participants said the mapping exercise was the most useful part. Several went back to their teams with a one-page list of changes, which is the result we hoped for.

Write to [hello@harborlane.example](mailto:hello@harborlane.example) if you want to host a shorter version in your company.
